# Knowledge Base Maintenance

- This project uses a living knowledge base in `KNOWLEDGE_BASE.md`.
- Update the knowledge base after every significant change (features, bugs, decisions, experiments, UX changes).
- After pulling, merging, or rebasing **significant** upstream work (new migrations, API surface, or product behavior), update the knowledge base in the same session so it stays aligned with `docs/API_SURFACE.md` and the database.
- Before any commit/PR, complete `KNOWLEDGE_BASE_UPDATE_CHECKLIST.md`.
- Keep `KNOWLEDGE_BASE.md` under ~500 lines; archive to `KNOWLEDGE_BASE_ARCHIVE.md` when needed.
- Update `KNOWLEDGE_BASE_QUICK_REF.md` when adding new patterns or fixes.
